+void MaybeSeedBundledWidevineCdm() {
+  // First-run only; a one-time ~17MB extraction at startup. Blocking file I/O
+  // here is fine: this is an official (non-DCHECK) build where thread blocking
+  // restrictions are not enforced, and the work runs exactly once per profile.
